========================================
  SMART HOME DASHBOARD
  How to Run
========================================

REQUIREMENTS:
  - Node.js 18+
  - pnpm


STEP 1 — Install dependencies (one time)
-----------------------------------------

  pnpm install


STEP 2 — Start servers (two terminals)
-----------------------------------------

  Open TWO terminal windows (PowerShell or WSL).

  Terminal 1 — API Server (port 8080):
    pnpm dev:api

  Terminal 2 — Frontend (port 5173):
    pnpm dev:web


STEP 3 — Open browser
-----------------------------------------

  http://localhost:5173


STOPPING
-----------------------------------------

  Press Ctrl+C in each terminal.


OTHER COMMANDS
-----------------------------------------

  pnpm build        — Typecheck + build all
  pnpm typecheck    — Typecheck only
  pnpm codegen      — Regenerate API from OpenAPI spec
